# Architecture — Feature-based Clean Architecture

Every feature follows Clean Architecture with three layers:

```
lib/
├── core/                    # Shared abstractions and utilities
│   ├── network/             # AppNetwork (Dio wrapper, interceptors)
│   ├── cache/               # AppCache (SharedPreferences / local cache)
│   ├── env/                 # AppEnv (dotenv config)
│   ├── di/                  # GetIt service locator setup
│   ├── routes/              # Named routes definitions
│   ├── theme/               # AppTheme, colors, typography
│   └── widgets/             # Reusable widgets (AppButton, AppCard, etc.)
│
├── features/
│   ├── home/
│   │   ├── data/            # DataSources, Repositories impl, Models
│   │   ├── domain/          # Entities, Repository contracts, UseCases
│   │   └── presentation/    # Pages, Widgets, BLoCs
│   ├── news/
│   │   ├── data/
│   │   ├── domain/
│   │   └── presentation/
│   └── ...
```

## Layer rules

- **domain/** is pure Dart — no Flutter imports, no external packages.
- **data/** implements domain contracts and depends on core abstractions (AppNetwork, AppCache).
- **presentation/** depends on domain only (UseCases/Entities). Never import data layer directly.
- Cross-feature communication goes through domain layer or shared core.

## Naming conventions

| Layer | Class suffix | Example |
|-------|-------------|---------|
| Entity | (none) | `Planet`, `Launch` |
| Model | `Model` | `PlanetModel`, `LaunchModel` |
| Repository contract | `Repository` | `NewsRepository` |
| Repository impl | `RepositoryImpl` | `NewsRepositoryImpl` |
| DataSource | `DataSource` | `NewsRemoteDataSource` |
| UseCase | `UseCase` | `GetNewsUseCase` |
| BLoC | `Bloc` / `Cubit` | `NewsBloc`, `ApodCubit` |
| Page | `Page` | `NewsPage`, `HomePage` |
| Widget | (descriptive) | `LaunchCard`, `PlanetCarousel` |
